[Name] GnomeSettingsDaemon
[Summary] GNOME settings daemon (session components)
[License] GPL-2.0-or-later
[Homepage] https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gnome-settings-daemon
[Description] org.gnome.SettingsDaemon.* autostart components for the pantheon.session; ships gnome-settings-daemon.pc. Built systemd-free with rfkill/NetworkManager/smartcard/usb-protection/wwan/wayland disabled.
